# One topic = one short clip (30–90 s). Fill every <<blank>>; `manualify fill <file>` finds targets for you.
@id     example
@title  <<title>>
@budget 45
@assert warn

cut                       # filmed, then edited out: page loads never reach the viewer
  go <<path, e.g. />>
  wait ready

== <<first section>>
say <<what this screen is for, in one sentence>>
point <<the thing to look at>> label="<<short label>>"

== <<second section>>
say <<what we do next and why>>
click <<button that starts it>> => expect <<what appears>> visible
type <<field>> "<<value>>"
click <<save / confirm button>> => expect <<proof it worked>> visible
say <<the result, and why it matters>>
